{
  "file": "Latent",
  "page": 41,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        54.185028076171875,
        237.7548828125,
        69.68902587890625
      ],
      "text": "Rationale for the recommendations",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        73.00768280029297,
        526.6813354492188,
        85.80768585205078
      ],
      "text": "Overall, the GDG judged that the potential benefits of targeted preventive treatment for MDR-TB contacts",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        87.00768280029297,
        526.6231689453125,
        99.80768585205078
      ],
      "text": "based on individual risk assessments outweigh the harm but acknowledged uncertainty about the efficacy",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        101.00768280029297,
        524.43017578125,
        113.80768585205078
      ],
      "text": "of the intervention due to the lack of RCTs. It also noted that provision of preventive treatment for MDR-",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.00768280029297,
        526.6022338867188,
        127.80768585205078
      ],
      "text": "TB contacts would be acceptable, particularly to patients and health care workers. The GDG stressed that",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.0076904296875,
        526.6392822265625,
        141.80767822265625
      ],
      "text": "treatment should be given to selected individuals after a careful risk assessment, including intensity of",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        143.0076904296875,
        526.7052001953125,
        155.80767822265625
      ],
      "text": "exposure, certainty of the source case, reliable information on the drug resistance pattern of the index case",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        157.0076904296875,
        526.5892944335938,
        169.80767822265625
      ],
      "text": "and potential adverse events. It should be given only to household contacts at high risk (e.g. children, people on",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        171.0076904296875,
        526.612060546875,
        183.80767822265625
      ],
      "text": "immunosuppressive therapy and people living with HIV). Confirmation of infection by LTBI testing is required",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        185.0076904296875,
        248.36114501953125,
        197.80767822265625
      ],
      "text": "before individualized treatment is initiated.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        213.02749633789062,
        235.1857147216797,
        228.531494140625
      ],
      "text": "Considerations for implementation",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        228.8712158203125,
        269.2049255371094,
        243.08322143554688
      ],
      "text": "Close monitoring and treatment adherence",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        246.684814453125,
        526.6732177734375,
        259.48480224609375
      ],
      "text": "Close monitoring of adverse events and adherence to treatment is essential. The types of adverse events",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.684814453125,
        526.7322998046875,
        273.48480224609375
      ],
      "text": "depend on the drugs used. Common adverse events associated with each drug are listed in the Companion",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        274.684814453125,
        526.6660766601562,
        287.48480224609375
      ],
      "text": "handbook to the WHO guidelines for the programmatic management of drug-resistant tuberculosis  .  (68)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        288.684814453125,
        526.7003173828125,
        301.48480224609375
      ],
      "text": "Adverse effects should be monitored according to the WHO framework for monitoring and managing the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        302.684814453125,
        526.6712036132812,
        315.48480224609375
      ],
      "text": "safety of drugs against active TB  . The GDG reiterated that strict clinical observation and close monitoring  (69)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8760986328125,
        316.684814453125,
        526.7200317382812,
        329.48480224609375
      ],
      "text": "for active TB disease based on sound clinical practice and national guidelines for at least 2 years is required,",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8760986328125,
        330.684814453125,
        526.7192993164062,
        343.48480224609375
      ],
      "text": "regardless of the provision of preventive treatment. Consideration should also be given to interactions with",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8760986328125,
        344.684814453125,
        457.2851867675781,
        357.48480224609375
      ],
      "text": "antiretroviral, immunosuppressant and other drugs when providing TB preventive treatment.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        369.8790283203125,
        154.9710235595703,
        384.0910339355469
      ],
      "text": "Informed consent",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        387.692626953125,
        526.6730346679688,
        400.49261474609375
      ],
      "text": "As the recommendation is based on very low-quality evidence, clients must be given detailed information",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        401.692626953125,
        526.6043701171875,
        414.49261474609375
      ],
      "text": "about the benefits and harms of the preventive treatment and asked for explicit informed consent. In view",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        415.692626953125,
        526.6232299804688,
        428.49261474609375
      ],
      "text": "of the uncertainty about the balance of benefit to harm, informed consent, preferably in writing, is required,",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        429.692626953125,
        321.5530700683594,
        442.49261474609375
      ],
      "text": "based on the local context and practice in similar situations.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        454.88690185546875,
        189.1776885986328,
        469.0989074707031
      ],
      "text": "Selection of drug regimen",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        472.7005310058594,
        526.662353515625,
        485.5005187988281
      ],
      "text": "The regimen of preventive treatment of MDR-TB contacts should be based on reliable information on the drug",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        486.7005310058594,
        526.679443359375,
        499.5005187988281
      ],
      "text": "resistance profile of the source case. Later-generation fluoroquinolones (e.g. levofloxacin and moxifloxacin) are",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        500.7005310058594,
        526.6651611328125,
        513.5005493164062
      ],
      "text": "considered to be important components of a preventive treatment regimen unless the strain of the source case",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        514.7005615234375,
        526.618408203125,
        527.5005493164062
      ],
      "text": "is resistant to them. Although there has been concern about the use of fluoroquinolones in children because",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        528.7005615234375,
        526.6822509765625,
        541.5005493164062
      ],
      "text": "retardation of cartilage development was shown in animals  , similar effects have not been demonstrated  (70)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        542.7005615234375,
        526.692138671875,
        555.5005493164062
      ],
      "text": "in humans . There is limited evidence for the duration of treatment, and this should be based on   (68, 71, 72)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86608123779297,
        556.7005615234375,
        505.4903259277344,
        569.5005493164062
      ],
      "text": "clinical judgement. The regimens used in the studies conducted so far were given for 6, 9 and 12 months.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        581.8948364257812,
        185.48825073242188,
        596.1068115234375
      ],
      "text": "Resources and feasibility",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        599.7084350585938,
        526.6500244140625,
        612.5084228515625
      ],
      "text": "For a programmatic approach, all the necessary resources should be in place, including for quality-assured",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        613.7084350585938,
        526.6454467773438,
        626.5084228515625
      ],
      "text": "testing for drug susceptibility, the necessary medications and a system for close monitoring of harm and",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        627.7084350585938,
        526.6792602539062,
        640.5084228515625
      ],
      "text": "adverse events. The feasibility of providing preventive treatment should be carefully assessed according to the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        641.7084350585938,
        481.6431579589844,
        654.5084228515625
      ],
      "text": "availability of resources and the history and status of preventive treatment for drug-susceptible TB.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        538.5827026367188,
        790.2608032226562,
        556.22265625,
        810.61279296875
      ],
      "text": "29",
      "font": "Whitney-Light",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        190.8560028076172,
        796.524658203125,
        524.4127807617188,
        805.5686645507812
      ],
      "text": "6. PREVENTIVE TREATMENT FOR CONTACTS OF PEOPLE WITH MULTIDRUG-RESISTANT TUBERCULOSIS",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}